[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17705.11, "timestamp": "04:55:05", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17708.07, "timestamp": "04:55:08", "text": "不是晚飯，是午餐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17718.07, "timestamp": "04:55:18", "text": "我要吃午飯，然後就停下來。我會停下來，嗨，空瓶子。下次遊戲再見。下次我直播這個遊戲的時候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17732.47, "timestamp": "04:55:32", "text": "嗨，今天就到這裡。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17735.11, "timestamp": "04:55:35", "text": "剛升到"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17737.284, "timestamp": "04:55:37", "author": "@abhaynair7276", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m3_pcx7bakRsuScPVawS3lNZlHTFLM8XHTpdd1EGU=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "this expedition was a perfect ending material"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17751.59, "timestamp": "04:55:51", "text": "7級。顯示重新載入進度。好的。今天就到這裡。好的。我們以後再做這些。我的意思是，我們可以慢慢來。我不做遠徵，所以我們要慢慢來，呃，慢慢來。所以，是的，"}]